\section{Artifact Appendix}

%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
\subsection{Abstract}
We implement \pname{} by building our emulation framework and an SSD prototype
described in (\S\ref{subsec:impl}). In this artifact, we provide the source code of \pname{} within the emulator version
and necessary instructions to reproduce key performance results
(Figure 6-11 in \S~\ref{sec:eval}). The emulator can be executed on any x86 machine with at least 96
GB of main memory and at least 64 GB of disk space. We strongly
recommend running the artifact with the emulator on a workstation with multi-cores
and at least 128 GB memory.

