\section{Experiments}
We evaluated the effectiveness of the proposed \textbf{\texttt{ZO-SAH}} algorithm on eight benchmark datasets, including six linear classification tasks using logistic regression and two image classification benchmarks using deep neural networks with two different architectures. We also present a simple two-dimensional optimization problem to illustrate how exploiting second-order curvature information improves performance over conventional zeroth-order approaches.\footnote{The code for our algorithm will be released online upon acceptance.}

