	\| \tilde{e}^{1}_\eta\|_{L^2}^2+a_\eta \tau \| \nabla \tilde{e}^{1}_\eta\|_{L^2}^2
	=&\tau(\frac{\tilde{e}^{1}_\eta- \tilde{e}^0_\eta}{\tau},w_h)
	+\tau(R^{1}_\eta,\tilde{e}^{1}_\eta)
