For the anti-coordination game, Fig.~\ref{fig:2D_anti_polarize_contour_diff} presents the two inequalities in \eqref{eq:condition_polarized_anti}. From the contour plot, it appears that $f(\lambda,\beta)= \frac12(1+\frac{\beta(1-\lambda)}{2\beta-\beta\lambda-1})-\frac{1-2\lambda}{1-\lambda}
