Similarly, for $i\in \mathcal{V}_{-1}^{-}(0)$, we use \eqref{eq:xcoo_cond_nn}, $\sum_{j\in \mathcal{V}_{1}^{+}(0)}w_{ij}=1-\sum_{k\in \mathcal{V}_{-1}^{-}(0)}w_{ik}$, and $y_k(0)\in[-1,0),\forall k\in\mathcal{V}_{-1}^{-}(0),y_j(0)\in(0,+1],\forall j\in\mathcal{V}_{1}^{+}(0)$ to bound
