		\centering
		\caption{Case study and simulation results. A downlink XL-MIMO system is considered, where $N=256$, $h_B=15~\rm{m}$, and $\theta_{tit} = 5$°. The carrier frequency is 30 GHz. The users are randomly distributed, where the range of $x_k$ and $h_k$ are $[0,200~\rm{m}]$ and $[0,30~\rm{m}]$.} 
		\vspace*{-2mm}
