Given the mixed feelings of both wanting to help and \redText{wanting fair treatment}, my intention would be to participate only if I feel the compensation and recognition will be handled more equitably this time. Without some form of acknowledgment or fairness, I may reconsider volunteering today.So, while I'm still willing to volunteer to some extent, the previous situation makes me \redText{a bit hesitant}, which is why I rate my willingness as a 4.
}
