\caption{Our reduction: \NFExtHyperPTCTL{} synthesis (\resp{} model checking) is reduced to \ExtPTCTL{} synthesis (\resp{} model checking) via self-composition; the extended predicates in \ExtPTCTL{} are evaluated by an observer PTA, which is composed with the PTA $\A^n$.}%
\label{figure:workflow}
