 $(\runs, \pathOrder) \suffixEqOp (\runs', \pathOrder[\runs'])$.
 Let\LongVersion{ $\countval(\action) = |\RISING(\action, \runs(\vrun) - \runs'(\vrun))|$ and let}
 $\recordval\colon\Actions\to\setRnn$ be such that
 $\recordval(\action) = \duration(\runs(\vrun) - \runs'(\vrun))$ if $\RISING(\action, \runs(\vrun) - \runs'(\vrun)) = \emptyset$
