\section{Multi-Dimensional Protocol Performance Analysis}

Running the simulations provided insights into the performance of the Epidemic and Prophet protocols under
the varying conditions of the different PNE phases. The following results were obtained for three key performance
metrics: delivery probability, overhead ratio, and latency. Each graph and its corresponding table display
how the protocols performed.

