                    &   This SATD instance persisted from release 1.1 to 2.2, during which the Truck Factor (TF) community smell was consistently detected. Following release 2.2, both the SATD and TF smell disappeared simultaneously. This pattern suggests that high TF can delay technical debt resolution, and that distributing team knowledge helps address lingering SATD, reinforcing the link between socio-technical bottlenecks and debt persistence. \\ \midrule
