\[ {\rm dist}(x,p_1q_2) 
    \geq {\rm dist}(q_2,p_1 p_3)\sin \angle p_3 p_1 q_2
    > 0.193\cdot \sin\frac{\pi}{30}
    > 0.0202> \frac{1}{50}.
\]
Overall, $x$ is at distance more than $\frac{1}{50}$ from the boundary of ${\rm conv}\{p_1,p_2,p_3, q_2\}$. We conclude that $B(x,\frac{1}{50})\subset{\rm conv}\{p_1,p_2,p_3, q_2\} \subset C$, as required.



